u, and persist when omitted or null. Give factual evidence and observed benefits, never claimed physical changes. Partial plans and protected-state edits are rejected.\nBatch up to four control queries. Each has section, search, ids:string[], offset>=0 and part>=0. Sections abilities/inventory/knowledge/projects/memory/state/observed; world may query only abilities. Exact IDs or text search; use empty search and ids for pagination. No implicit access outside this scope. Remaining query batches are explicit; when zero return a decision. Every model response, including retrieval and failure, consumes the shared budget.\nPlan horizon: every decision is a paid model response, while executing a plan is free. Prefer plans that cover the foreseeable routine for many rounds: give steps a repeat count with until (for example gather until an inventory amount, rest until energy is high), use plan repeat and until for cycles, and use guards and supplied interrupt events for conditions that should end the plan early. A single one-execution step is appropriate when its observed result decides what comes next.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0b978be509347432016b08d26d7c1887d199e54317bc236a0b","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABrCNJtSZps7b6bFwEIDmus55VL6DGMZlMcU8fxFDk_5xqouF_5RDICau7LMmfWURNQrywB7hVceCBAkldDJFASqh_k1iYWP2nXS4v6QvLKtHTOxtdqoYGvbBCT_Z_R2spl96cLqjSioB2B-hzYwKTxulq3OXHQ7xWtpyX77hwBF6C5ft1AYkcD_bF6F_V3hbMUjlrK7UVTEd8KnVemSGr8-q009R2YzUBjJowdP5YTvWjxIYijr-9kuz55HIg4ZW_zaEdUu-BfbefNru7cA-DeSYto2Nd7lgOAgOUzba-x5IQ5oX9DrQ7W3xcXJPQJKk2NY8Qef05mvQlfnTIGs0Ry8rS9IAZpt1FvOHleXEMYl2Q-Ju2WEOvgD7ANNrUfjfO5MetnDiL_YXcWipLl6TweVeUgPkVptTxAznixVyA6LvUC6FcIIJrhCVF2nCVqetP873ZuJ_Qifc89In-Ovk3-KzY9u0ITPvS4AeY9jn37m_H5NuWFrD3QV7midKnpwWWvDQ9P5t-9culLyHrm9jvqWRHv_pQebMihcq3M4gcr1zOphq-5sYbCmWSDHFn9RcARzr_4rqUbodUgrxwachUPZr3eZMsSYc6jkk5-csSgUV_Tw_o6E3CST4BT-vdv1kNiUmGzr5H596eAVlcjONIdErkGiIGnAbS4Vu6fB39SMIDUwsJCzirU71IpO6syW_rNBSQDI-kshY95k_NncpAeD6yDSVSgwWNKBM_E